            "action_name": {
              "value": "Badger Rage"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate, emotion, mental)\n\nThe giant badger enters a state of pure rage that lasts for 1 minute, until there are no enemies it can perceive, or until it falls unconscious, whichever comes first.\n\nWhile raging, the giant badger has AC 17, its jaws Strike deals 1d8+8 damage, and its claw Strike deals 1d6+6 damage. While raging, the giant badger also can't use actions that have the concentrate trait except for Seek.\n\nAfter it has stopped raging, a giant badger can't use Badger Rage again for 1 minute."
            },
